<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as a base */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-info { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">UAF</h1>
      <div class="header-info" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        UNIVERSITY OF ALASKA<br>
        FAIRBANKS
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;">(907) 474-7964 • 474-7056</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 2px;">Fax (907) 474-5213</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 2px;">www.uaf.edu/uaf</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Governance Office</div>
      <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">America's Arctic University</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">MEMORANDUM</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">TO:</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><span data-field="recipient_name">{{ recipient_name }}</span>, <span data-field="recipient_title">{{ recipient_title }}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">FROM:</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><span data-field="sender_name">{{ sender_name }}</span>, <span data-field="sender_title">{{ sender_title }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 60%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">DATE:</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><span data-field="memo_date">{{ memo_date }}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">SUBJECT:</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;"><span data-field="memo_subject">{{ memo_subject }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <p>Attached please find a copy of the approval for <span data-field="course_name">{{ course_name }}</span> – <span data-field="course_code">{{ course_code }}</span> – <span data-field="course_description">{{ course_description }}</span>, <span data-field="course_credits">{{ course_credits }}</span> credits (<span data-field="course_level">{{ course_level }}</span>), as a <span data-field="semester">{{ semester }}</span> <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span> stacked trial course.</p>
    <p>I may be contacted at <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span> if you have any questions or need further information.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Attachment</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>cc:</p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <li><span data-field="cc_list[{{ 0 }}]">{{ cc_list[0] }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="cc_list[{{ 1 }}]">{{ cc_list[1] }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="cc_list[{{ 2 }}]">{{ cc_list[2] }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="cc_list[{{ 3 }}]">{{ cc_list[3] }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span data-field="document_date">{{ document_date }}</span>
  </div>

  <div style="line-height: 1.6;">
    <p>The Graduate Academic &amp; Advisory Committee of the Faculty Senate approved the following trial course:</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">GRADUATE/UNDERGRADUATE COURSE REQUEST</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">SCHOOL OF FISHERIES AND OCEAN SCIENCES</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">(Submitted by the Graduate Program in Marine Sciences &amp; Limnology)</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">I-Tr. Trial Course: <span data-field="trial_course_name">{{ trial_course_name }}</span> – <span data-field="trial_course_code">{{ trial_course_code }}</span> – <span data-field="trial_course_description">{{ trial_course_description }}</span>, <span data-field="trial_course_credits">{{ trial_course_credits }}</span> credits (<span data-field="trial_course_level">{{ trial_course_level }}</span>); to be stacked as <span data-field="stacked_course_code">{{ stacked_course_code }}</span>; letter graded and not repeatable; prerequisites include graduate standing for <span data-field="prereq_course_1">{{ prereq_course_1 }}</span>, and <span data-field="prereq_course_2">{{ prereq_course_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="prereq_course_3">{{ prereq_course_3 }}</span>, and <span data-field="prereq_course_4">{{ prereq_course_4 }}</span>, or permission of instructor for <span data-field="prereq_course_5">{{ prereq_course_5 }}</span> level; to be offered alternate spring; first offering in <span data-field="trial_year">{{ trial_year }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Effective: <span data-field="effective_semester">{{ effective_semester }}</span></p>
    <p>Rationale: See request attached.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>
        <p>APPROVED:</p>
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Chancellor's / Provost's Office</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <p>DATE:</p>
        <div class="signature-line" style="width: 150px;"></div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">10/4/10</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>
        <p>DISAPPROVED:</p>
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Chancellor's / Provost's Office</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <p>DATE</p>
        <div class="signature-line" style="width: 150px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>